Homepage: https://bottom.pages.dev/stable
Description: A customizable cross-platform graphical process/system monitor for the
 terminal. Supports Linux, macOS, and Windows.
 .
 By default, bottom will look for a config file in ~/.config/bottom/bottom.toml.
 A config file can be specified using `-C`. If a config file does not exist at
 the specified or default location, a default one will be created for the user
 there.

